This writ petition has been filed, inter alia, for the following reliefs;
"A. Issue a writ order or direction in the nature of certiorari quash the impugned order dated 24.1.2019 passed by the respondent no. 2 in Case No. 921/2016 (State Vs.
Atul) under section 52 (1) of National Food Security Act 2011 (Contained as Annexure No. 7) to the writ petition.
